1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,315
As Uke makes the thrust

2
00:00:01,316 --> 00:00:05,670
step to his front side making atemi 
and deflecting the knife simultaneously

3
00:00:05,971 --> 00:00:08,096
Bring the movement all the way around 
in front of you

4
00:00:08,097 --> 00:00:09,940
controlling his wrist and the knife.

5
00:00:09,941 --> 00:00:14,741
As you throw down take the knife away 
and place Uke down in front of you in Shiho-nage.

